Epithet provides short-lived SSH certificates, per-connection SSH agents,
and local host enrollment. The host enrollment command configures sshd to
authorize destination-bound principals without a persistent Epithet process.

The package also installs disabled-by-default rc.d services for the combined
server or standalone CA, control, directory, and inventory services. Each
service uses a preserved flat TOML configuration file and runs under a
dedicated unprivileged account.
